      "title": "JEE Main 2023 (10 Apr Shift 2)"
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> be in an arithmetico-geometric progression. If the common ratio of the corresponding geometric progression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> and the sum of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> terms of the arithmetico-geometric progression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> is equal to ______________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> be in an arithmetico-geometric progression,</p><p>And&nbsp;the common ratio of the corresponding geometric progression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> and the sum of all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> terms of the arithmetico-geometric progression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,common ratio&nbsp;Here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and let common difference&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>And we know that,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now adding all above equations&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>31</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>98</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
